    "body": "In this episode of Denatured, presented by Cytiva, Jennifer Smith-Parker speaks to Nicolas Pivet, VP & GM, Manufacturing & Digital Solutions at Cytiva. In this episode, we explore how biopharma’s real bottleneck isn’t too little data—it’s too little confidence in the decisions that drive development, manufacturing and commercialization.\n> Listen on Spotify > Listen on Apple Podcasts > Listen on Amazon Music > Watch on YouTube\nIn this episode of Denatured, presented by Cytiva, Jennifer Smith-Parker speaks to Nicolas Pivet, VP & GM, Manufacturing & Digital Solutions at Cytiva. In this episode, we discuss how biopharma has long invested in more data and visibility, yet many programs still face delays and scale-up surprises. The real challenge isn’t information overload—it’s building confidence in the decisions that steer scientific progress from development through commercialization.\nThis episode is presented in partnership with Cytiva .\nHost Jennifer Smith-Parker , Director of Insights, BioSpace\nGuest Nicolas Pivet, VP & GM, Manufacturing & Digital Solutions, Cytiva\nDisclaimer: The views expressed in this discussion by guests are their own and do not represent those of their organizations.",
